     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><font size=\"4\">各位先進你們好,日前拿到一份資料,需使用R進行分析,遇到一些問題,想把排列方式轉換進行機率分析,</font><div><font size=\"4\">我用手繪的方式說明如下:</font></div><div><br></div><div><font size=\"4\">(1)把原本的使用者轉換成欄位(矩陣),且會遇到</font><font size=\"4\">有</font><span style=\"font-size:large\">些資料不一定都有存在</span></div><div><a href=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/-B6wXc7cDyS4/WNOBRpOVe6I/AAAAAAAAAAQ/7T22rNtyfVItWDgwGU5Uvn2N_bBkTcHowCLcB/s1600/IMG_6695.JPG\" style=\"text-align:center;clear:left;margin-bottom:1em;margin-right:1em;display:inline!important\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/-B6wXc7cDyS4/WNOBRpOVe6I/AAAAAAAAAAQ/7T22rNtyfVItWDgwGU5Uvn2N_bBkTcHowCLcB/s1600/IMG_6695.JPG&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1793237748956000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3OIUWr1TYNg7e2-rLlYs3p\"><img src=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/-B6wXc7cDyS4/WNOBRpOVe6I/AAAAAAAAAAQ/7T22rNtyfVItWDgwGU5Uvn2N_bBkTcHowCLcB/s320/IMG_6695.JPG\" border=\"0\" width=\"320\" height=\"320\"></a><br></div><div><br></div><div><font size=\"4\">(2)重新改變資料排列,將前後的的關係列出來變成新的表格</font></div><p style=\"text-align:center;clear:both\"><a href=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/-gD2zB4O148c/WNOBNPzLC3I/AAAAAAAAAAM/EWP_4CTf3Wkqv7xuojLZzLFh_gnlnl4mgCLcB/s1600/IMG_6694.JPG\" style=\"clear:left;margin-bottom:1em;float:left;margin-right:1em\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/-gD2zB4O148c/WNOBNPzLC3I/AAAAAAAAAAM/EWP_4CTf3Wkqv7xuojLZzLFh_gnlnl4mgCLcB/s1600/IMG_6694.JPG&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1793237748956000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3Zp4bzhTxj1do02vxuOra-\"><img src=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/-gD2zB4O148c/WNOBNPzLC3I/AAAAAAAAAAM/EWP_4CTf3Wkqv7xuojLZzLFh_gnlnl4mgCLcB/s320/IMG_6694.JPG\" border=\"0\" width=\"320\" height=\"320\"></a></p></div>"
