     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\">Hi friend,<div><br></div><div>第1個問題應該是長資料(long data)轉換為寬資料(wide data), 可採用2種套件解決, 以下示範 spread , dcast 的方法. 第2個問題建議提供詳細資料與詳細問題說明.</div><div><br></div><div>1. tidyr 套件</div><div><br></div><div>gather : wide --&gt; long</div><div>spread : long --&gt; wide</div><div><br></div><div>2. reshape2 套件</div><div><br></div><div>melt : wide --&gt; long</div><div>dcast : long to wide</div><div><br></div><p style=\"text-align:left;clear:both\"><a href=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/-w14CVq6ZEJA/WNYWB64ASHI/AAAAAAAALXY/CESwzsJCW5M-cdzQj_hLzYCRsOUaPvpjwCLcB/s1600/%25E9%2595%25B7%25E8%25B3%2587%25E6%2596%2599%2528Long%2Bdata%2529%25E8%25BD%2589%25E7%2582%25BA%25E5%25AF%25AC%25E8%25B3%2587%25E6%2596%2599%2528Wide%2Bdata%2529.png\" style=\"margin-left:1em;margin-right:1em\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/-w14CVq6ZEJA/WNYWB64ASHI/AAAAAAAALXY/CESwzsJCW5M-cdzQj_hLzYCRsOUaPvpjwCLcB/s1600/%2525E9%252595%2525B7%2525E8%2525B3%252587%2525E6%252596%252599%252528Long%252Bdata%252529%2525E8%2525BD%252589%2525E7%252582%2525BA%2525E5%2525AF%2525AC%2525E8%2525B3%252587%2525E6%252596%252599%252528Wide%252Bdata%252529.png&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1793237748957000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3ZIhdCIU-b17Z4te0Jj_3i\"><img src=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/-w14CVq6ZEJA/WNYWB64ASHI/AAAAAAAALXY/CESwzsJCW5M-cdzQj_hLzYCRsOUaPvpjwCLcB/s400/%25E9%2595%25B7%25E8%25B3%2587%25E6%2596%2599%2528Long%2Bdata%2529%25E8%25BD%2589%25E7%2582%25BA%25E5%25AF%25AC%25E8%25B3%2587%25E6%2596%2599%2528Wide%2Bdata%2529.png\" border=\"0\" width=\"360\" height=\"400\"></a></p><div><br></div><div><br></div><div><div style=\"background-color:rgb(250,250,250);border-color:rgb(187,187,187);border-style:solid;border-width:1px;word-wrap:break-word\"><code><div><font color=\"#666600\"><div># title: 長資料(Long data)轉為寬資料(Wide data)</div><div># date: 2017.3.25</div><div><br></div><div>id &lt;- rep(1:3, 3)</div><div>items &lt;- gl(3, 3, labels = c(&quot;甲&quot;,&quot;乙&quot;,&quot;丙&quot;))</div><div>measurement &lt;- c(&quot;A&quot;,&quot;B&quot;,&quot;C&quot;,NA,&quot;B&quot;,&quot;D&quot;,&quot;B&quot;,&quot;C&quot;,&quot;D&quot;)</div><div>mydf &lt;- data.frame(id, items, measurement)</div><div>mydf</div><div><br></div><div># 方法1: tidyr 套件</div><div>library(tidyr)</div><div>mydf_wide &lt;- spread(mydf, items, measurement)</div><div>mydf_wide</div><div><br></div><div># 方法2: reshape2 套件</div><div>library(reshape2)</div><div>mydf_wide2 &lt;- dcast(mydf, id ~ items, value.var=&quot;measurement&quot;)</div><div>mydf_wide2</div><div># end</div></font></div></code></div><br><a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">fylo...@gmail.com</a>於 2017年3月23日星期四 UTC+8下午4時12分32秒寫道：</div></div>"
    ],
    [
     3,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><div><blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"margin:0;margin-left:0.8ex;border-left:1px #ccc solid;padding-left:1ex\"><div dir=\"ltr\"><font size=\"4\">各位先進你們好,日前拿到一份資料,需使用R進行分析,遇到一些問題,想把排列方式轉換進行機率分析,</font><div><font size=\"4\">我用手繪的方式說明如下:</font></div><div><br></div><div><font size=\"4\">(1)把原本的使用者轉換成欄位(矩陣),且會遇到</font><font size=\"4\">有</font><span style=\"font-size:large\">些資料不一定都有存在</span></div><div><a href=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/-B6wXc7cDyS4/WNOBRpOVe6I/AAAAAAAAAAQ/7T22rNtyfVItWDgwGU5Uvn2N_bBkTcHowCLcB/s1600/IMG_6695.JPG\" style=\"text-align:center;clear:left;margin-bottom:1em;margin-right:1em;display:inline!important\" rel=\"nofollow\" target=\"_blank\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/-B6wXc7cDyS4/WNOBRpOVe6I/AAAAAAAAAAQ/7T22rNtyfVItWDgwGU5Uvn2N_bBkTcHowCLcB/s1600/IMG_6695.JPG&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1793237748957000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0acp-VxfUSPK3vCtMTH_Y4\"><img src=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/-B6wXc7cDyS4/WNOBRpOVe6I/AAAAAAAAAAQ/7T22rNtyfVItWDgwGU5Uvn2N_bBkTcHowCLcB/s320/IMG_6695.JPG\" border=\"0\" width=\"320\" height=\"320\"></a><br></div><div><br></div><div><font size=\"4\">(2)重新改變資料排列,將前後的的關係列出來變成新的表格</font></div><p style=\"text-align:center;clear:both\"><a href=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/-gD2zB4O148c/WNOBNPzLC3I/AAAAAAAAAAM/EWP_4CTf3Wkqv7xuojLZzLFh_gnlnl4mgCLcB/s1600/IMG_6694.JPG\" style=\"clear:left;margin-bottom:1em;float:left;margin-right:1em\" rel=\"nofollow\" target=\"_blank\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/-gD2zB4O148c/WNOBNPzLC3I/AAAAAAAAAAM/EWP_4CTf3Wkqv7xuojLZzLFh_gnlnl4mgCLcB/s1600/IMG_6694.JPG&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1793237748957000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0CNqzv5JoPO0lX5PNa2TVa\"><img src=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/-gD2zB4O148c/WNOBNPzLC3I/AAAAAAAAAAM/EWP_4CTf3Wkqv7xuojLZzLFh_gnlnl4mgCLcB/s320/IMG_6694.JPG\" border=\"0\" width=\"320\" height=\"320\"></a></p></div></blockquote></div></div>"
